{"id":"wb-3-155","name":"一百零八塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"一百零八塔","text":"一百零八塔，位于中华人民共和国宁夏回族自治区吴忠市青铜峡市的黄河岸边，因有108座喇嘛砖塔而得名，是中国规模最大的喇嘛塔群。该建筑群的建造时间未知，仅可知在明代之前建造完成，塔中曾出土西夏时期的文物。1988年，一百零八塔入选全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%80%E7%99%BE%E9%9B%B6%E5%85%AB%E5%A1%94","revisionId":93360960,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93360960","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/97c5df1f80762598deb3872c.jpg","title":"一百零八塔.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%B8%80%E7%99%BE%E9%9B%B6%E5%85%AB%E5%A1%94.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/18/%E4%B8%80%E7%99%BE%E9%9B%B6%E5%85%AB%E5%A1%94.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Smwy09","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​宁夏青铜峡一百零八塔","width":320,"height":427}}